msgstr "ຕ້ອງກຳນົດ Bancontact PPID ເພື່ອສ້າງ URL ຂອງສະຕິກເກີ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_bancontact_pay.pos_payment_method_view_form_inherit_bancontact_pay
msgid "Bancontact Pay"
msgstr "Bancontact Pay"

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Bancontact Pay only supports these currencies: %(currencies)s.\n"
"The linked journal uses a different currency."
msgstr ""
"Bancontact Pay ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະສະກຸນເງິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້: %(currencies)s.\n"
"ບັນຊີປະຈຳວັນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງນຳໃຊ້ສະກຸນເງິນອື່ນ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_bancontact_pay.field_pos_payment_method__bancontact_api_key
msgid ""
"Bancontact Pro Portal > Admin Centre > Shops and products > Select a product "
"> Manage API keys > View API key"
msgstr ""
"Bancontact Pro Portal > Admin Centre > ຮ້ານຄ້າ ແລະ ສິນຄ້າ > ເລືອກສິນຄ້າ > ຈັດການ API "
"keys > ເບິ່ງ API key"

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_bancontact_pay.field_pos_payment_method__bancontact_ppid
msgid ""
"Bancontact Pro Portal > Admin Centre > Shops and products > Select a shop > "
"Read the product ID from the card"
msgstr ""
"Bancontact Pro Portal > Admin Centre > ຮ້ານຄ້າ ແລະ ສິນຄ້າ > ເລືອກຮ້ານຄ້າ > ອ່ານລະຫັດສິນ"
"ຄ້າ (product ID) ຈາກບັດ"

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/errors/http.py:0
msgid "Bancontact is currently unavailable. Please try again later."
msgstr "Bancontact ບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນເວລານີ້. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Bancontact payments can only be cancelled for payment methods using "
"Bancontact Pay as provider."
msgstr ""
"ການຊຳລະເງິນ Bancontact ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້ສະເພາະວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ໃຊ້ Bancontact Pay ເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້"
"ບໍລິການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Bancontact payments can only be created for payment methods using Bancontact "
"Pay as provider."
msgstr ""
"ການຊຳລະເງິນ Bancontact ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ສະເພາະວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ໃຊ້ Bancontact Pay ເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້"
"ບໍລິການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Bancontact sticker URL can only be generated for payment methods configured "
"with 'Static Sticker' usage."
msgstr ""
"URL ຂອງສະຕິກເກີ Bancontact ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ສະເພາະວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳໃຊ້ເປັນ 'Static "
"Sticker' ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: pos_bancontact_pay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_bancontact_pay/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Bancontact sticker URL can only be generated for payment methods using "
"Bancontact Pay as provider."
msgstr ""
"URL ຂອງສະຕິກເກີ Bancontact ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ສະເພາະວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ໃຊ້ Bancontact Pay ເປັນຜູ້ໃ"
"ຫ້ບໍລິການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

